      "content": "reevaluate? i dont even know what that means anymore. i've tried everything to make this work, but the more i try to change things, the more i realize that i'm the one who made this mess. i'm the one who built the cage. it's like there's no version of my life where i'm not just... stuck. there's no way to fix a person who's fundamentally broken. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to give.",
